WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.978
Chain lifts on one bar.

00:00:02.433 --> 00:00:08.331
Open Complex Builder. Pick a lift, and the list shows what fits next.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:13.411
Chain them in order. Every gap between lifts is checked as you go.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:19.254
Weights come from your records. The limiting lift sets the load for the whole chain.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.369
Lifting Lab is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
